# Simulation output (~11 GB) -- provided separately, see the README.
# Covers a real fds/sim/ directory, a symlink to a shared copy, and any
# local dataset backup kept next to it. tests/fixtures/ carries the
# trimmed data the test suite needs.
fds/sim
fds/sim*/

# Large media assets from the 2019 outreach event (425M + 647M). The one
# application asset drawn from here (the FZJ logo) is tracked separately
# at src/logo/logo_fzj.svg.
banner/
image_video_sim/

# Runtime caches and ML outputs
.cache/
predictions/

# ML training artifacts (regenerable from ml/ scripts + ml/README.md,
